 "notes": "Level_01 — Movement explanation\n\nChapter 1 · Movement explanation. Target difficulty 1/10.\n\nTeaches the two controls and the one rule behind them: a press sends that chick one tile around the other, which stays put as the anchor. The left chick circles clockwise, the right one counter-clockwise, so the pair walks by alternating.\n\nNothing on the board can block, push or kill. The only thing to learn is that both chicks must stand in the coops at once.\n\nShortest solution: 4 steps (LLRR).",
